@host = http://localhost:5071
@userId = 1

### Get my profile  (200)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/profile
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
Accept: application/json

### Get my profile without auth header  (401)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/profile
Accept: application/json

### Update my profile  (200)
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/profile
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Ahmed",
  "lastName": "Mohamed",
  "email": "ahmed@example.com",
  "phoneNumber": "+201234567890"
}

### Update profile with invalid data  (400 validation)
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/profile
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "A",
  "lastName": "Ali",
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "phoneNumber": "123"
}

### Get my settings (grouped)  (200)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/settings
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
Accept: application/json

### Update settings - PARTIAL (only the sent fields change)  (200)
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/settings
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "preferences": { "theme": "dark", "language": "ar" },
  "notifications": { "workoutReminders": false },
  "privacy": { "profileVisibility": "public" }
}

### Upload profile picture (JPG/PNG, max 5MB)  (200)
# Replace ./me.png with a real image path before sending.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/profile/picture
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="profilePicture"; filename="me.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./me.png
------WebKitFormBoundary--

###
